# ─── Claude Code worktrees ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/worktrees/
# .claude/ is gitignored wholesale; negate ONLY the subpaths we commit:
#   - settings.json (permissions.deny + credential-read hook registration)
#   - hooks/block-credential-read.sh
#   - skills/search-fast/ (project skill)
# settings.local.json stays ignored (personal overrides).
# NOTE: contents-pattern (/*) not dir-pattern — git cannot re-include files
# inside an excluded parent directory.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
!/.claude/hooks/block-credential-read.sh
!/.claude/skills/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/search-fast/
!/.claude/skills/search-fast/SKILL.md

# ─── Editor / cursor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cursor/*
# Project rules + CLI permissions are version-controlled per Cursor docs
!.cursor/rules/
!.cursor/cli.json

